title: Predictive Curve Lighting (Map & Camera-Based Dynamic Bending)
raw_community_title: Predictive Curve Lighting (Adaptive Front Lighting System)
category: Lighting
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2025
trim: All
source_sheet: Euro Kuga Mk3.5 / Ranger 6G Matrix LED Comparison & Livnitup Master
  Database
author: Firn
validated: true
status: verified
notes: 'Upgrades the Dynamic Bending Headlamps from reactive steering-wheel-only mode
  (1) to anticipatory Map/Camera-Based Dynamic Bending (4), using the IPMA front lane-tracking
  camera and SYNC 4 Navigation Electronic Horizon map stream to pre-steer the headlamp
  projectors into upcoming curves before turning the steering wheel. Also enables
  the Predictive Lighting toggle in SYNC 4 Settings > Vehicle > Lighting.

  IMPORTANT — GLARE-FREE HIGH BEAMS MUST BE ENABLED: Glare-Free Matrix High Beams
  (ADB/DBL Combined) MUST be enabled in the HCM for the 734-11-01 checksum (F11D5B)
  to be valid. Applying this modification without Glare-Free enabled will throw an
  HCM configuration/checksum DTC.

  IMPORTANT — EXACT HCM NIBBLE VALUES REQUIRED: All HCM edits (734-04-02 and 734-11-01)
  must be written as exact nibble values (never relative offsets), otherwise the HCM
  secondary CRC checksum will fail. For alternative HCM combinations, an external
  HCM checksum calculator is required — reach out to Firn on the F-150 Lightning Forum
  or 14th Gen F-150 Forum to discuss.'
steps:
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-05-01
  notes: 'Add +8 to existing value: 0 -> 8 (CSLT Table A, 2022-2024 Pro/XLT) or 1 ->
    9 (CSLT Table B, 2023-2025 Pro/XLT). Higher trims (Flash/Lariat/Platinum) already
    have 8 or 9 from factory — do not change 9 to 8.'
  targets:
  - mask: xx*x xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '8'
    offset_hint: '+8'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 1
      feature_name: Electric Horizon (EH)
      target_state: EH Electronic horizon EH
    - bit: 2
      action: 0
      feature_name: Electric Horizon Type (EHT)
      target_state: EHT MPP + Stubs
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-09-01
  notes: 'Add +1 to existing value: 4 -> 5 (trucks without ACC, e.g. Pro) or 6 -> 7
    (trucks with ACC). Writing 5 on an ACC-equipped truck will disable the ACC menu.'
  targets:
  - mask: '*xxx xxxx xx--'
    community_hex: '5'
    offset_hint: '+1'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 0
      action: 1
      feature_name: Adaptive Head Lamps Control Function (AHLCF)
      target_state: AHLCF Enabled
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-09-03
  notes: Add +8 to existing value (0 -> 8 across all trims).
  targets:
  - mask: '*xxx xxxx xx--'
    community_hex: '8'
    offset_hint: '+8'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 1
      feature_name: Predictive Lights (PL)
      target_state: PL Enabled
- module: IPC
  address: 720-09-02
  notes: 'Add +1 to existing value: 0 -> 1 (trucks without ACC, e.g. Pro) or 2 -> 3
    (trucks with Intelligent ACC). Writing 1 on an ACC-equipped truck will disable
    Intelligent ACC in the IPC.'
  targets:
  - mask: '*xxx xx--'
    community_hex: '1'
    offset_hint: '+1'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 0
      action: 1
      feature_name: Adaptive Headlamps Feature (AHF)
      target_state: AHF enabled
- module: IPC
  address: 720-10-01
  notes: Add +2 to existing value (0 -> 2 across all Lightnings).
  targets:
  - mask: xx*x xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '2'
    offset_hint: '+2'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 1
      action: 1
      feature_name: Predictive Lights (PL)
      target_state: PL enabled
- module: HCM
  address: 734-04-02
  notes: 'Set to exact nibble value 4 (Map/Camera Based Dynamic Bending Enabled) —
    do NOT use an offset. Requires Glare-Free High Beams to be enabled for the 734-11-01
    checksum (F11D5B) to validate.'
  targets:
  - mask: x*xx xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '4'
    type: discrete
    # Bit positions preserved for future AsBuiltPro HCM CRC calculator support:
    # bits:
    # - bit: 2
    #   action: 1
    #   feature_name: m2_Bending_Enable (BE)
    #   target_state: BE Map/Camera Based Dynamic Bending Enabled
    # - bit: 1
    #   action: 0
    #   feature_name: m2_Bending_Enable (BE)
    #   target_state: BE Map/Camera Based Dynamic Bending Enabled
    # - bit: 0
    #   action: 0
    #   feature_name: m2_Bending_Enable (BE)
    #   target_state: BE Map/Camera Based Dynamic Bending Enabled
- module: HCM
  address: 734-11-01
  notes: 'Exact HCM calibration CRC & line checksum block (F11D 5B) for Glare-Free
    + Predictive Curve Lighting. Must be entered as exact nibble values with Glare-Free
    High Beams enabled.'
  targets:
  - mask: '*xxx xxxx xx--'
    community_hex: F
    type: discrete
  - mask: x*xx xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '1'
    type: discrete
  - mask: xx*x xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '1'
    type: discrete
  - mask: xxx* xxxx xx--
    community_hex: D
    type: discrete
  - mask: xxxx *xxx xx--
    community_hex: '5'
    type: discrete
  - mask: xxxx x*xx xx--
    community_hex: B
    type: discrete
recipe_version: '1.1'
